Aim

To develop an online electronics shopping system for browsing, purchasing, and tracking electronic products.

Algorithm
Start the program.
Register and log in to the system.
Browse categories and search for products.
View product details and check availability.
Add products to the cart and proceed to checkout.
Make payment and track the order status.
Admin manages products, categories, prices, and customer details.
Stop the program.
Result

Thus, the online electronics shopping system was designed to manage product browsing, shopping cart operations, online purchases, and order tracking efficiently.
